           "text": "@Dan Field"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": " Thank you so much for solving that! I will discuss it with my colleagues from the development team, but I guess we will take a safe path to wait for next official release. We didn’t move to 6.5 so far, but we plan to in near future. I hope we won’t need to reindex until then.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Or if you would be so nice to produce 6.4.2 build so we can easily move to this version, it will be perfect. However, I don’t know how complicated this is.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
