     "body": "<p>Tested Davids use case against Bens PR <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2086\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2086</a> </p>\n\n\n<p>membership table is now populated on reindex. PR merged</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=70121%3Abc4e5839-97af-495c-9ccd-ae12309a105a\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"70121:bc4e5839-97af-495c-9ccd-ae12309a105a\" data-account-id=\"70121:bc4e5839-97af-495c-9ccd-ae12309a105a\" accountid=\"70121:bc4e5839-97af-495c-9ccd-ae12309a105a\" rel=\"noreferrer\">David Novák</a> are you in a position to be able to build and test this within your environment or do you need to wait for a new release build?</p>",
