     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" data-account-id=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" accountid=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Dan Field</a> Thank you so much for solving that! I will discuss it with my colleagues from the development team, but I guess we will take a safe path to wait for next official release. We didn’t move to 6.5 so far, but we plan to in near future. I hope we won’t need to reindex until then.</p>\n\n<p>Or if you would be so nice to produce 6.4.2 build so we can easily move to this version, it will be perfect. However, I don’t know how complicated this is.</p>",
